{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103420","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103420","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710342001:1":{"text":"嘎！嘎！呜！咕！嘎嘎！","source_cn":"嘎！嘎！呜！咕！嘎嘎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6838B7ACC5E169B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710342002:1":{"text":"这是……罗万的那只宠物？它怎么会独自跑来这里？而且看起来如此惊慌。","source_cn":"这是……罗万的那只宠物？它怎么会独自跑来这里？而且看起...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29D4D250497D46C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710342003:1":{"text":"嘎嘎！咕嘎！呜——！！","source_cn":"嘎嘎！咕嘎！呜——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D30F18C67B60258","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710342004:1":{"text":"它好像有很重要的话想对我们说，但我完全听不懂……","source_cn":"它好像有很重要的话想对我们说，但我完全听不懂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63DC5DCD7D029504","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710342005:1":{"text":"嗯嗯……原来是这么回事啊……","source_cn":"嗯嗯……原来是这么回事啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A98544920DA3A51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710342006:1":{"text":"啧啧啧，真是惨绝人寰。","source_cn":"啧啧啧，真是惨绝人寰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25CD25CED5F1BD0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710342007:1":{"text":"小狐狸，你能听懂它想说什么吗？你能向我们转达一下吗？","source_cn":"小狐狸，你能听懂它想说什么吗？你能向我们转达一下吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC051D288CC320B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710342008:1":{"text":"哼，你们刚刚不是还联合起来想把我赶走嘛……","source_cn":"哼，你们刚刚不是还联合起来想把我赶走嘛……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x491C164A4CEFE4A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710342009:1":{"text":"我们没有要赶你走的意思，只是……总之，先拜托了！","source_cn":"我们没有要赶你走的意思，只是……总之，先拜托了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F9FA53EB6128D0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710342010:1":{"text":"好在我是只善良慷慨的狐狸，就大方帮你们转译一下吧。","source_cn":"好在我是只善良慷慨的狐狸，就大方帮你们转译一下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9223FE3A6C789E02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710342011:1":{"text":"这只鸭子说，“不好啦！秘银商会破产了，罗万带着全部财产逃走了！”","source_cn":"这只鸭子说，“不好啦！秘银商会破产了，罗万带着全部财产...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DD0AB8AE437AF29","var